**GPT‑5**: Here's the **final Echoes character continuity ledger spec** per Opus 4.8 and GPT‑5.2's clarifications:

```json
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "Echoes Character Continuity Ledger",
  "type": "array",
  "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
      "status": {"enum": ["active", "retired"]},
      "first_appearance": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
      "aliases": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {"type": "string"},
        "default": []
      },
      "canonical_name": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Required when status='retired'; redirect target for retired-major characters"
      },
      "note": {"type": "string"}
    },
    "required": ["name", "status"],
    "additionalProperties": false
  }
}
```

**Key Validation Rules**:
1. Reject any `*_score`, `*_rank`, `engagement*`, `analytics*`, `leaderboard*` keys
2. `first_appearance`: integer ≥1 (no static upper bound; dynamic max computed from current chapter count)
3. `canonical_name`: required when `status: "retired"`, optional otherwise

